        d.p('This memorandum helps the investor and its advisers plan and carry out due diligence on both projects. It lists the documents Jalour will provide, the legal and regulatory structure, the evidence behind the main assumptions, the opinions and security documents required, a candid list of red flags, and the open items. It describes status as at October 2026. Items marked [After NDA] are provided after the investor signs the non-disclosure agreement (template provided in this pack); items marked [Pending] are being prepared. It is not legal advice.')
        d.p('Where this memorandum and the Investment Memorandum differ, the Investment Memorandum and the Financial Annex are the reference for figures; the definitive agreements prevail over both.')
        d.h1('Contents')
        items = ['1. Corporate and project-company structure', '2. Al Ahly Sabbour agreements and consent status', '3. Permits, licences and land status', '4. Construction and cost basis', '5. Sales and pricing evidence', '6. Legal and regulatory structure, and opinions required', '7. Security documentation', '8. Structures considered and rejected', '9. Risks and mitigants', '10. Red-flag disclosure list', '11. Questions an investor is likely to ask', '12. Data-room index', '13. Open items']
        for t in items:
            par = dd.add_paragraph(); par.paragraph_format.space_after = Pt(3); par.paragraph_format.tab_stops.add_tab_stop(Cm(16.3), alignment=2, leader=1)
            r = par.add_run(t + '\t' + (str(toc.get(t, '')) if toc else '')); r.font.size = Pt(11)
        d.h1('1. Corporate and project-company structure')
        d.table([['Layer', 'Entity', 'Status'], ['Holding', 'Al Jalal Holding, Cairo', '[After NDA]'], ['Sponsor and developer', 'Jalour Developments', '[After NDA]'], ['Project companies', 'One for each project [names, jurisdiction and capital to be confirmed]', 'To be formed or confirmed; each holds its project rights and issues the investor entitlement for its project'], ['Landowner', 'Al Ahly Sabbour', 'Counterparty under the development agreement for each plot'], ['Investor', '[Name]', 'KYC and source-of-funds to be completed']], [3.6, 5.8, 6.9], 'Structure', -1, font=9.5, bold_first_col=True)
        d.bullets(['Each project is held in its own company. There is no cross-collateral and no cross-default between the projects. The investor places EGP 62.5 million in each in a single transaction.', 'The legal form of the investor\'s entitlement (equity, loan or contractual entitlement) is open and drives tax, regulation and enforceability. Counsel to advise; see section 6.', 'No funds are ring-fenced or held in restricted accounts under the proposed structure. Jalour\'s position is that the rule requiring a separate project account for developers on state-allocated land does not apply to these plots; the basis is in the data room.', BAL + ' This applies in each project.', 'All information in this memorandum, in the pack and in the data room, including the financial information of both projects, is covered by the non-disclosure agreement.'])
        d.p('Jalour may raise further capital at project or holding level, subject to the investor\'s stated rights as to ranking, collateral and information. This is a standard term and does not offer exclusivity.')
        d.h1('2. Al Ahly Sabbour agreements and consent status')
